    "changelog": "Initial pack. The management add-ons are the software-addressable part of the assessment: poor internal controls +0.02%, late return submission +0.01%, financial misreporting +0.03%, weak risk management +0.02%, non-compliance with examiners' recommendations +0.02%, within an overall add-on cap of 0.30%. Rates are stored on the requirements as guidance, not as penalties, because they adjust a premium rather than fine an entity. Every date, threshold and penalty in this pack is drawn from the phase-8 research brief and has NOT been confirmed against the regulator’s primary document. The pack ships unverified: its records are usable internally but excluded from generated regulatory submissions until a person verifies them (rule R10).",
